OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged with murder after
OL,4,Awoman found dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a woman's body was found in a
OL,8,FLincolnshire village.
OL,10,FHayley Marson, 33, was found dead at a
OL,11,Fproperty on Thames Street, in
OL,12,FHogsthorpe, near Skegness, at about
OL,13,F09:00 BST on Tuesday, Lincolnshire
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FOn Friday, John Scott, 52, of no fixed
OL,17,Faddress, and John Welby, 65, of Thames
OL,18,FStreet, Hogsthorpe, appeared at Lincoln
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court charged with her
OL,20,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
