OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged with murder after
OL,4,Awoman found dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth men were remanded into custody and
OL,7,Fare due to appear at Lincoln Crown
OL,8,FCourt on Monday, the force added.
